  <data name="OptionalString" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>&lt;div style="text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color: black; font-size: 20px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 700; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;Class Policies and Reminders: &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #717171; font-size: 20px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 400; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;Students are expected to maintain a respectful and professional demeanor during lessons and adhere to a code of conduct. Regular attendance is vital, and timely notification is required for any rescheduling. A stable internet connection is crucial for online lessons, with backup plans for connectivity issues. Lessons are strictly scheduled in terms of duration. Regular practice with recommended materials is encouraged, and students are typically allowed to record lessons for personal use or practice. In case of the instructor's absence or the need to cancel a lesson, every effort will be made to provide makeup lessons or refunds. Open communication for questions, concerns, or feedback is highly encouraged to maintain a productive and respectful learning environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</value>
