  <data name="OverviewString" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color: #343D4C; font-size: 20px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 700; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;Title&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #717171; font-size: 20px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 400; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;-Use clear and concise language to describe your service. Include relevant keywords that potential clients might search for.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• The subject you are teaching&lt;br/&gt;• Your qualifications and teaching approach&lt;br/&gt;• What sets you apart, mention your expertise, fast delivery, or any special features.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Examples:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #717171; font-size: 20px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 400; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;“Beginner-Friendly Online Piano Lessons by a Professional Pianist”&lt;br/&gt;“Piano Lessons with a Certified Music Teacher - Get Started Now”&lt;br/&gt;“Professional Piano Lessons for Beginners”&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #717171; font-size: 20px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 400; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #343D4C; font-size: 20px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 700; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;Description&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #717171; font-size: 20px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 400; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;-Provide a detailed description of what you offer, emphasizing the unique aspects of your service. Highlight your skills and expertise, and explain how your service can solve your clients' problems or meet their needs.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #717171; font-size: 20px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 400; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;Why Choose This Class?&lt;br/&gt;Class Overview&lt;br/&gt;Class Schedule&lt;br/&gt;About the Instructor&lt;br/&gt;Teaching Approach&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ScheduleString" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color: #717171; font-size: 20px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 400; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;Here's a sample schedule for offering piano lessons. This schedule is based on providing lessons for different category needs of a student:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #343D4C; font-size: 20px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 700; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;Sample Schedule:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #717171; font-size: 20px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 400; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;Offering 1: Comprehensive Beginner's Package&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #717171; font-size: 20px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 400; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;$150/ 10 Sessions&lt;br/&gt;Monday &amp; Tuesday 4:00pm-7:00pm&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #717171; font-size: 20px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 400; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Offering 2: Classical Piano Masterclass&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #717171; font-size: 20px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 400; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;$400/ 10 Sessions&lt;br/&gt;Monday &amp; Tuesday 12:00pm-3:00pm&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #717171; font-size: 20px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 400; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Offering 3: Song-Specific Piano Lessons&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #717171; font-size: 20px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 400; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;$50/ 1 Session&lt;br/&gt;Schedule will be determined with the enrollee&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SupportingPhotoString" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>&lt;div style="text-align: justify"&gt;
    &lt;span style="color: #343D4C; font-size: 20px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 700; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;High-Quality Images&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
