  <data name="OnlineEventString" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>&lt;div style="width: 746px"&gt;
&lt;span style="color: #343D4C; font-size: 18px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 700; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;1. URL&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span style="color: #717171; font-size: 18px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 400; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;-Choose a dependable hosting platform for your event page, such as Zoom or Google Meet.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span style="color: #343D4C; font-size: 18px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 700; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;2. Title&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span style="color: #717171; font-size: 18px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 400; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;-This title will reflect to your hosting platform URL. Make sure to use keywords relevant to your event.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span style="color: #343D4C; font-size: 18px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 700; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;3. Description&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span style="color: #717171; font-size: 18px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 400; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;-This will be the description in your hosting platform URl. These are some details you can add to your description.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul style="list-style-type:disc; color: #717171; font-size: 18px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 400; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Explain the event's purpose, agenda, and key details.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Include speaker information and event logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Specify the date, time, and time zone.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Provide clear instructions on joining through Zoom or Google Meet.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Highlight any special features or benefits. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;  
&lt;span style="color: #343D4C; font-size: 18px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 700; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;4. Ticket Restriction&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span style="color: #717171; font-size: 18px; font-family: Nunito; font-weight: 400; word-wrap: break-word"&gt;-Ticket Restriction involves specifying unique features or benefits associated with particular ticket types. If a specific ticket offers distinct experiences or services, attendees can choose it, and if there are no specific preferences, they can opt for the "ALL" option.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</value>
  </data>
